WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Owlhead is a trading agent for your own brokerage account.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:15.000
You write its rules in plain English. Before you confirm, it shows you what it understood, in dollars.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.000
It looks for ideas, and writes each one down with its reason and what would prove it wrong.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Every order is sized and checked against your rules. If your rules say to ask, it waits on your phone until you approve it.

5
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Before any order goes out, it writes down what it read, what it concluded and who approved it. Edit a line and the chain stops matching.

6
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.000
It trades on paper first, with simulated money. One Stop button halts every agent. It can't take money out of your account.

7
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Owlhead is in private beta. Ask for a place at owlhead.ai.
